**Connections as done on Arduino Uno, and Supporting Peripherals.**

Adafruit OLED Display (128x64): Uses SPI bus (MOSI=11, CLK=13, DC=7, CS=6, RESET=8).
HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Distance Sensor: Connected to Trig=9 and Echo=3.
Flex Sensor (Glove/Finger): Analog input A1 with Calibration Button D5.
User Controls & Audio: Potentiometer at A0, Reset Button at D2, Piezo Speaker/Buzzer at D4.

