| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Display** | SSD1306 OLED | `D11` (MOSI) | SPI Data Line |
| | | `D13` (CLK) | SPI Clock Line |
| | | `D7` (DC) | Data / Command Select |
| | | `D6` (CS) | Chip Select |
| | | `D8` (RESET) | Display Hardware Reset |
| **Distance Sensor** | HC-SR04 Ultrasonic | `D9` | Trigger Output |
